The board is a list of 1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, and 1.
The last is the last position of board.
The ships is 0.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The row is spot divided by 4.
The column is spot modulo 4.
The top is 0.
If row is 0, set top to 1.
If row is more than 0 and item (spot minus 4) of board is 0, set top to 1.
The left is 0.
If column is 0, set left to 1.
If column is more than 0 and item (spot minus 1) of board is 0, set left to 1.
If item spot of board is 1 and top is 1 and left is 1, add 1 to ships.

Show ships.
